        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hui-chieh:"
    },
    {
        "text": "The storm hasn't broken for days. The whole valley's snowed over."
    },
    {
        "text": "The raspberry bushes still haven't budded. It's like spring'll never come."
    },
    {
        "text": "We're trapped here, starving, dressed thin, and every silent day we pass waiting for the snow to melt drives us out of our minds."
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, there's something about it all I find odd."
    },
    {
        "text": "We've never once had a smooth time of it. Any better circumstances, and they'd go to shit fast the moment I get involved."
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe it really is like the Lungmenites say. I'm a bad omen. Nothing good comes of being around me."
    },
    {
        "text": "Reminds me of something from a hell of a long time ago."
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been thinking how I need to share my thoughts with you, in order to find peace."
    },
    {
        "text": "December 14th"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 4
    },
