    },
    {
        "text": "Third year without the Black Snake"
    },
    {
        "text": "A small Ursus hamlet"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah, get back here! You can't let them see you like that, for heaven's sakes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry! I'm coming in now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_snowconutryinside",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorclosequite",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why won't you just take those clothes off?! I've said it over and over, they'll bring those damned bugs around!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those big, black, poisonous bugs... One bite and a whole field goes barren!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I always wear my normal clothes, don't I? I've only been wearing these lately because I had to be outside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "You remember the gentleman who gave me these clothes, don't you? The handsome one. He wouldn't recognize me in anything else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "I believe destiny will send him to me again. When that time comes, you and your husband can both live happily ever after.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Bah! Talulah... Talulah! A bald-faced liar, that's what you are. What about everything you said before, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh. What was it I said before? I've forgotten. It was the same, wasn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You said your father gave you these clothes as a birthday gift!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "You said he was robbed blind by some ring-headed foreigner, and you ran off crying, these clothes soaked in his blood!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're all over the place... The time before that was a different story too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, so I can't keep it straight? Your memory's just wonderful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't suck up to me! Always talking complete nonsense... I've got a foot in the grave, but look at you, running an old coot like me in circles. Don't you feel even a bit of shame?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah. I'm sorry, that's wrong of me. Really.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now sit down! Don't bother with your clothes! Driving me up the wall!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Chop, chop! Polish off that lunch already. You told me you'd be back by noon and the sun's almost down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "I left the soup on for you, but it's nearly boiled dry now. You may as well be having your supper at this rate!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, dear Majesty, how could our little girl turn out this way...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get that down, you. The old man still wants you for something. Oh, that miserable drunk! Where's he run off now...? You'll have to find him yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, I get it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph! You grew up so well, but not a single true word comes out of your mouth! Just like all those sweet-talking youngsters in the city!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "I nearly got swindled once when I was younger... There's nothing good about them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough... I've heard this one a hundred times.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talking back! Right... here. Oh, come on, take your plate now! And eat your bread, snappity-snap!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't rush like that! You'll choke!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "...*Sigh*, you were all soaked in blood the day you showed up, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still get chills thinking about it, Talulah. If you weren't one of those good kids, the old man would've split your head open with a hatchet right then and there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Who can even tell if someone else is good or bad at a single glance...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That day you ran here, it was an evening dark as dark was, with all beasts crawling outside. Burdenbeasts or meatbeasts, they never stopped howling! Really made me uneasy...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "And then, and then that thing you were carrying...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Unf, pff... *cough* *cough*!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What a big knife it was! I'd never seen one so big in all my years!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That was a sword... a sword! Not a knife. And don't take it to clear out mountain paths again. That's not what it's for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "And by the way! Didn't we agree never to speak of that again? I'm getting upset.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoops, my big mouth! Pfeh! Oh, Emperor above! I won't say a word more, not a single word of it again! Oh, Your Majesty, forgive an old blabbermouth for her careless slip!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's enough. Surely the Emperor's in no place to care. He's living it up just fine in his grand old city, and us? We can't even find potatoes to eat next week. He couldn't do anything for us, even if he wanted to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "For that matter, I'm wondering if you even know who the Emperor is now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How rude!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "The soup... are we out of salt?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes! We ran out a while ago. The salt jar went empty last night! Hmph, you're just as wasteful as that old man! Eating all our salt... you'll pickle yourselves dead!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "And Lord knows what in the world you're up to when you leave for days at a time! You come back with nothing, no money, not even a thing to eat! A girl driving this house to ruin...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I get it, I get it. I'm changing it out now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So healthy you are! You ought to be working!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't bother. I had a chat with Alina just a minute ago. She'll bring us some salt. Now look at you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alina is a lot more reliable than you! She likes her studying, she gets hands-on with her work, and you still can't even sew your own clothes!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...To each their own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh? What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone has her own ambitions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So what ambitions have you got? Ought to find someone good, a strong lad 'n' lass! If we leave you to do the work, mossoat'll be rotting underground before long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I haven't slacked once on the yearly farmwork.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_093#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You've only been here how many years?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah never falls behind on her work. Please stop scolding her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "??? "
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093",
        "name2": "avg_npc_079",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alina! You need to help me talk some sense into her, or else she'll keep going on like this, and...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093",
        "name2": "avg_npc_079",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And there's not much wrong with that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_079",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, at last, you're here. You're the only one who knows how to quiet her down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you're all grown up, are you! Think you're a noble just because you draped yourself in some uniform you got from Lord-knows-where? Small as you are, you put on airs anyway! Where'd you learn that...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have work to do! You two eat up. If you're hungry, Alina. Talulah, don't eat too much! Leave some for Alina.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, alright... alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be fine, Ma'am. Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah, I've brought some salt over. The salt merchant will be here next week, so remember to buy some then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you so, so much, Alina. Without you, she'd be going on for another twenty minutes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can hear you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_079",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Where'd you go this time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_079",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nowhere, just out for a walk to feel the wind. Right, the landscape painting you wanted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_079",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, you actually remembered. Thank you, thank you a lot, Talulah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "This brush type... This isn't by the local painters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "The old painter in Shmyr only knows hard strokes. I can't imagine him using a feather brush. These soft tips, this was a nighteye's plumage... from before it molted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah, you went to the city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_079",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Can't hide anything from you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_079",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why hide things from me? I'm not Gendarmerie. Or a tax collector.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_079",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't need to know about any of it. It's danger all around there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_079",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And you're in the thick of it, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_079",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079"
    },
    {
        "text": "The deer facing her seemed almost supernatural. The white-haired Draco felt, deep down, that if you didn't want Alina to know what was happening, your best option was not to let those things happen at all."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just saying... Alina, you don't need to worry about th\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "text": "Trouble! There's trouble...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's all the racket about?! Storming in without even knocking! I don't know what I'll do if the bolt's broken!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The... The Infected Patrol Unit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Farmer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your old man brought this rabble on us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_079#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Talulah! Where are you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_093#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, the knife! Alina, don't let her wave that thing around!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
